<view class="page"><member-brand/><view class="compose"><view class="compose-title">告诉 Agent 你的情况与需求</view><view class="muted">只需三个必要信息，不要求写成长问卷；提交后统一人工审核。</view><input class="textarea" value="{{who}}" maxlength="180" placeholder="我是谁，例如：产业研究员" data-field="who" bindinput="input"/><textarea class="textarea" value="{{why}}" maxlength="300" placeholder="为什么找，例如：希望验证行业判断" data-field="why" bindinput="input"/><textarea class="textarea" value="{{target}}" maxlength="300" placeholder="找哪类人或机会" data-field="target" bindinput="input"/><picker range="{{modes}}" range-key="label" value="{{modeIndex}}" bindchange="selectMode"><view class="textarea">处理方式：{{modes[modeIndex].label}}</view></picker><view class="compose-actions"><button class="voice" bindtap="record">{{recording?'停止录音':'◉ 语音说明'}}</button><button class="submit" bindtap="submit">提交人工审核</button></view><view class="voice-hint">{{voiceNotice}}</view></view><view class="notice">模型未配置；规则仅生成草稿，不会自动发布、推送或释放联系方式。</view><view class="section"><view class="section-title">我的匹配请求</view><view class="row" wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id"><text class="tag tag-green">人工审核中</text><view class="muted">不返回私密匹配结果或联系人</view></view></view><scroll-view class="chips" scroll-x><view class="chip {{active===item.key?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}</view></scroll-view><view class="row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><text class="tag tag-green">{{item.type}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.distributionLabel}}</text><view class="row-title">{{item.anonymousTitle}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.anonymousSummary}}</view><view class="muted">已人工审核 · 联系方式从不公开</view><button class="button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="apply">申请对接</button></view></view>
